WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Watch where the strongest, driest wind comes from.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Plant across that wind on the side it comes from.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Keep the row long and continuous. Wind speeds up through a gap.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Let some wind through the trees. Behind a solid wall, the wind tumbles and swirls.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Put tall trees on the windward side, medium trees next, then low shrubs.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Leave space between the trees and crops so light can reach the beds.
